      "id": "claim_d633c6fbfdf24403a88fe735916a36bf",
      "statement": "The actor's timer slots deliberately do not coalesce by key where it would cancel safety: cell alarms coalesce to the newest arming, but OperationDeadline is keyed per operation (a shared slot would leave every activation but the most recent with nothing watching it) and QueuedActivation is keyed per cell and generation; non-restore operations carry a deadline, CELD_OPERATION_DEADLINE_MS defaulting to 15000 ms.",
