    {
      "id": "claim_e0ba2f3515154d07a85725ba804bb806",
      "statement": "Deployment moves at safe points: an adoption builds the new deployment beside the current one and moves a resident object only at a safe point (no running request, no running alarm handler, no output awaiting durability, no regular WebSocket open), preserving storage, epoch, and hibernatable WebSockets without touching the bucket; an object that reaches no safe point within CELD_DEPLOY_MAX_AGE_S (default 60; 0 forces immediately) is forced — work cancelled and regular WebSockets closed with code 1012 — and during the window adjacent versions must accept each other's calls.",
